sequenceDiagram
	participant Customer as Customer (Storefront)
	participant Rating as Rating API (.NET 11)
	participant Cosmos as Cosmos DB (ratingdb/feedbacks)
	participant Kafka as Kafka (CloudEvents)
	participant Catalog as Catalog API (.NET 11)
	participant Postgres as PostgreSQL (catalogdb)

	Customer ->> Rating: HTTPS POST /rating/api/v1/feedbacks
	Rating ->> Cosmos: Persist Feedback document (/bookId)
	Rating ->> Kafka: Publish FeedbackCreatedIntegrationEvent
	Rating -->> Customer: 201 Created
	Kafka ->> Catalog: Deliver bookworm.{env}.rating.feedback-create
	Catalog ->> Postgres: Load Book by BookId

	alt Book exists
		Catalog ->> Postgres: Update average_rating & total_reviews
	else Book missing
		Catalog ->> Kafka: Publish BookUpdatedRatingFailedIntegrationEvent
		Kafka ->> Rating: Deliver bookworm.{env}.catalog.book-update-rating-failed
		Rating ->> Cosmos: Delete orphaned Feedback document
	end
